    reg {
        name = "Power switch control register";
        desc = "MISC_CTRL3 is a power switch control register.

Power switch control for the two MMC controllers (SD card voltage/enable); each switch can be driven by the MMC controller or by the register. Reset 0xCA = both sources set to the register, outputs 3.3 V disabled.

Data sheet 3.5.5.2 MISC_CTRL3 (offset 0xC, printed page 3-76, `hi3516av200--Hi3516AV200-Datasheet.txt` line 8076).";

        enum MISC_CTRL3_powerswitch1_enable_mux_enum {
            MMC1_CONTROLLER = 0 { name = "Mmc1 Controller"; desc = "MMC1 controller"; };
            POWERSWITCH1_ENABLE_REGISTER = 1 { name = "Powerswitch1 Enable Register"; desc = "powerswitch1_enable register"; };
        };

